# ASTERIX Category 247, Version Number Exchange, edition 1.3: one data block holding one record.
# Public. Generated by tools/gen/asterix2pack.py from the category definition of
# github.com/zoranbosnjak/asterix-specs (BSD-3-Clause); do not edit by hand. I/O is hex text.
# Needs engine version 0.8 (`layout sequential`). See pack.md.
#
#   octet 1       CAT = 247
#   octets 2-3    LEN, the length of the data block in octets, CAT and LEN included
#   FSPEC         octets of 7 presence bits and an extension bit; bit n is FRN n
#   then          the items whose FSPEC bit is 1, in FRN order
#
# An FRN with no `if` block is not mapped: a record with that FSPEC bit set fails
# with `malformed-wire` (ruling 1 of engine-spec 0.8), and encode never sets the bit.
format     asterix-cat247
version    0.1.0
distribution public
source  "ASTERIX Category 247, Version Number Exchange, edition 1.3 (2021-08-31), as transcribed in github.com/zoranbosnjak/asterix-specs (BSD-3-Clause), commit 64e9ffba964b92a1af3157bc6bdf7852a63bf700, specs/cat247/cats/cat1.3/definition.json. The category is specified by EUROCONTROL"
uses       cat247
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
kind    record
when    8  247                              # CAT
length  16 whole                         # LEN
presence f fx
if f.1                                   # FRN 1, I247/010 Data Source Identifier
  field  cat247.i010_sac  8  uint
  field  cat247.i010_sic  8  uint
end
if f.2                                   # FRN 2, I247/015 Service Identification
  field  cat247.i015  8  uint
end
if f.3                                   # FRN 3, I247/140 Time of Day
  field  cat247.i140  24  uscale:1/128
end
if f.4                                   # FRN 4, I247/550 Category Version Number Report
  group  cat247.i550  count 8
    field  cat247.i550_cat  8  uint
    field  cat247.i550_main  8  uint
    field  cat247.i550_sub  8  uint
  end
end
# FRN 5: spare FRN
if f.6                                   # FRN 6, I247/SP Special Purpose Field
  length 8 bytes plus 1                # the length octet counts itself; the content is not mapped
  end
end
if f.7                                   # FRN 7, I247/RE Reserved Expansion Field
  length 8 bytes plus 1                # the length octet counts itself; the content is not mapped
  end
end
